{"unit_id":"yangyue1974__dsh-plugin-audiolib#feature-1","repo":"yangyue1974/dsh-plugin-audiolib","commit":"bb9a037bd8c5c7706214a8cc4359dbd219642657","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"功能「状态联动配乐」：监听会话轮次开始和结束事件，分别使用工作曲库与空闲曲库；曲目播放到结束后才按最新状态切换。可在设置中关闭自动联动。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:153-158","src/ambient.ts:160-176"]}
{"unit_id":"yangyue1974__dsh-plugin-audiolib#feature-2","repo":"yangyue1974/dsh-plugin-audiolib","commit":"bb9a037bd8c5c7706214a8cc4359dbd219642657","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"功能「选择曲库」：模型调用 music_play 并传入曲库 ID，可指定后续播放的音乐；正在播放时会排到当前曲目结束，静音时则立即开始。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:192-234","src/ambient.ts:132-150"]}
