{"unit_id":"yangyue1974__dsh-plugin-audiolib#caveat-1","repo":"yangyue1974/dsh-plugin-audiolib","commit":"bb9a037bd8c5c7706214a8cc4359dbd219642657","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-audiolib 需要 AudioLib API 密钥；每次取曲目时会向 api.audiolib.ai 发送曲库 ID，并以密钥授权请求。密钥可通过凭据设置或对应环境变量提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:116-123","src/audiolib.ts:149-160"]}
